  "description": "The proposal seeks to bring vacant and underutilised floorspace back into active use, contributing to local housing supply while enhancing the condition,\nfunctionality, and long-term viability of the building with the proposed change of use from Use Class E(g)(i) (previously B1) to C3 Dwelling houses.\n\nThe upper floors comprise vacant, stripped-back office accommodation that has remained unused for over 20 years. The space is currently in shell condition and highlights the declining demand for small-scale office space in this area and the opportunity to repurpose redundant floorspace to meet local housing needs.",
